
## 1️⃣ IME Capsule Schema (what one memory record looks like)

Think of this as **“one mission’s biography”**:

* 1 SEU snapshot at the moment of action
* 1 OU that was activated
* 1 PDCA cycle
* 1 Outcome Evaluation
* All frozen with timestamps

You can name it `IME_Record` (or `MissionMemoryRecord` if you prefer).

